### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@module = classroom

### Login as superadmin (save the token for subsequent requests)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/loginUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "superadmin@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login as school admin (save the token for subsequent requests)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/loginUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "schooladmin@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Create a new classroom (requires school admin or superadmin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/createClassroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "name": "Class 1A",
    "schoolId": "<your_school_id>",
    "capacity": 30,
    "grade": "1",
    "section": "A"
}

### Get a specific classroom
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/getClassroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "classroomId": "<classroom_id>"
}

### List all classrooms (filtered by school for school admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/listClassrooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "schoolId": "<optional_school_id>"
}

### Update a classroom
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/updateClassroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "classroomId": "<classroom_id>",
    "name": "Class 1B",
    "capacity": 25,
    "grade": "1",
    "section": "B"
}

### Delete a classroom (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/deleteClassroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "classroomId": "<classroom_id>"
}

### Example Workflow:

### 1. Create School (as superadmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/school/createSchool
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <superadmin_token>

{
    "name": "Test School",
    "address": "123 Education St",
    "email": "test.school@example.com",
    "phone": "1234567890"
}

### 2. Create Classroom in that school
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/createClassroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <school_admin_token>

{
    "name": "Class 1A",
    "schoolId": "<school_id_from_step_1>",
    "capacity": 30,
    "grade": "1",
    "section": "A"
}

### 3. List Classrooms for the school
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/listClassrooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <school_admin_token>

{
    "schoolId": "<school_id_from_step_1>"
} 